    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "There is and there isn't",
     "texto": [
      "**Masada ekmek var** = there is bread on the table. **Masada peynir yok** = there is no cheese on the table.",
      "**Var** says that something exists or is available; **yok** denies that it exists.",
      "Food names take no definite article («the»): **ekmek** can mean «bread» or «the bread», depending on context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
